nagement games are quite a  niche genre but as it's free my advice  is always give it a try you never know  this might be your type of game you just  never tried it before and finally back  on the ps4 is ufc 4 a fight fest with  notable improvements from previous games  in that series ufc is all about fighting  prows mastering many forms of mixed  martial arts ufc 4 has attempted to make  the game easier on new players but it  still retains the crazy level of depth  for pros 2. the grappling system has  been refined with assisted transitions  and the career mode has been overhauled  to feel more like a genuine career path  of a professional with training for  fights while assessing your next  opponent as this is an ea game there  have been issues no doubt for example  they once added in-game adverts forcing  us all to watch luckily like other  things ea introduced this has now been  removed and they apologized for it  there's over 200 fighters to choose from  and a new commentary team to call the  shots ufc 4's reviews average at 8 out  of 10 so it's worthy of our time so  that's our games for february 2022 what  you're thinking please do me a favor and  review them in the comments below i'm  adam you're awesome i'll see you next  time  [Music]  you

